---
description: >-
  Extends the mixed regular-message/self-reference scenario with
  self-referencing loops that also carry circle markers at both ends (dual
  central connection) and a reverse-arrow dual central connection,
  autonumber enabled throughout.
config:
  sequence:
    diagramMarginX: 50
    diagramMarginY: 10
---
%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Alice
  participant Bob
  participant Charlie

  Alice->>Bob: Regular message
  Bob->>Bob: Self-reference solid
  Bob-->>Charlie: Regular dotted
  Charlie()->>()Charlie: Self-ref dual central
  Charlie->>Alice: Regular back
  Alice<<->>Alice: Self-ref bidirectional
  Alice()->>Bob: Regular with central
  Bob()/|-()Bob: Self-ref reverse dual central
  Bob-->>Alice: Regular dotted back
